## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical handling of release risk tied to capacity and SLOs; emphasizes rapid telemetry-driven decision making, traffic control, and deterministic rollback.

## Key Concepts
- Feature flags and gated rollouts
- Canary vs. full rollback strategies
- SLOs/SLIs, latency and error budgets
- Telemetry, dashboards, and alert thresholds
- Circuit breakers and autoscaling

## Code Example
